  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *evitado*",
    "*evitar + infinitive* = to avoid doing something (*Evita comer mucho azúcar* — Avoid eating too much sugar)",
    "*evitar + noun* = to avoid something (*Evito el tráfico por las mañanas* — I avoid traffic in the mornings)",
    "*evitar que + subjuntivo* = to prevent something from happening (*Evita que te encorves* — It prevents you from hunching over)",
    "Related: *la evitación* = avoidance; *evitable* = avoidable; *inevitable* = inevitable"
  ],
